{
  "id": "createpackage:package_distributors",
  "items": [
    "createpackage:package_distributor",
    "createpackage:basic_package_distributor",
    "createpackage:advanced_package_distributor",
    "createpackage:incomplete_package_distributor"
  ],
  "title": {
    "en_us": "Package Distributors",
    "zh_cn": "封包分发器"
  },
  "tags": ["createpackage:create_package"],
  "editable": false,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": {
        "en_us": "Package Distributors: Overview",
        "zh_cn": "封包分发器：总览"
      },
      "steps": [
        { "type": "encapsulate_bounds", "bounds": [5, 4, 5] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "createpackage:package_distributor", "blockPos": [1, 1, 1] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "createpackage:basic_package_distributor", "blockPos": [2, 1, 1] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "createpackage:advanced_package_distributor", "blockPos": [3, 1, 1] },
        { "type": "show_section_and_merge", "direction": "down", "blockPos": [1, 1, 1], "blockPos2": [3, 1, 1] },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 10 },
        {
          "type": "highlight_section",
          "color": "blue",
          "duration": 50,
          "blockPos": [1, 1, 1],
          "blockPos2": [3, 1, 1]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 70,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "blue",
          "point": [2.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Package Distributors receive a whole AE2 processing pattern and feed it to a real Create sequenced assembly line.",
            "zh_cn": "封包分发器接收一整份 AE2 处理样板，并把它送入真实的 Create 序列组装流水线。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 80 },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 90,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "point": [2.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Pick by setup: the normal one needs an AE2 Pattern Provider beside it, the Basic one has its own pattern slots, and the Advanced one reads the route from each pattern.",
            "zh_cn": "按用途选择：普通款需要旁边接 AE2 样板供应器；基础款自带样板槽；高级款从每张样板读取路线。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 95 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "package_distributor",
      "title": {
        "en_us": "Package Distributor: Setup",
        "zh_cn": "封包分发器：接入方式"
      },
      "steps": [
        { "type": "encapsulate_bounds", "bounds": [5, 4, 5] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "ae2:pattern_provider", "blockPos": [1, 1, 0] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "createpackage:package_distributor", "blockPos": [1, 1, 1] },
        { "type": "show_section_and_merge", "direction": "down", "blockPos": [1, 1, 0], "blockPos2": [1, 1, 1] },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 10 },
        {
          "type": "highlight_section",
          "color": "white",
          "duration": 50,
          "blockPos": [1, 1, 0],
          "blockPos2": [1, 1, 0]
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight_section",
          "color": "blue",
          "duration": 50,
          "blockPos": [1, 1, 1],
          "blockPos2": [1, 1, 1]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "blue",
          "point": [1.5, 2.6, 0.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Connect the distributor to the ME network. Place an AE2 Pattern Provider beside it, and put the processing patterns in the provider.",
            "zh_cn": "将分发器接入 ME 网络，在旁边放置 AE2 样板供应器，并把处理样板放进供应器。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 85 },
        {
          "type": "show_controls",
          "duration": 50,
          "point": [1.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "direction": "down",
          "action": "right",
          "item": "createpackage:machine_linker"
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 10 },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 90,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "point": [1.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Use the Machine Linker: right-click the distributor to select it, then right-click the route blocks in item-flow order.",
            "zh_cn": "使用机器链接器：先右键分发器将其选中，再按物品流向依次右键路线中的方块。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 95 },
        {
          "type": "show_controls",
          "duration": 40,
          "point": [1.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "direction": "down",
          "action": "right",
          "whileSneaking": true,
          "item": "createpackage:machine_linker"
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 10 },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "point": [1.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Sneak-right-click a linked block to unlink it. Sneak-right-click the distributor to clear all links.",
            "zh_cn": "潜行右键已链接的方块可取消链接；潜行右键分发器可清空全部链接。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 85 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "route",
      "title": {
        "en_us": "Package Distributors: Create Route",
        "zh_cn": "封包分发器：装配路线"
      },
      "steps": [
        { "type": "encapsulate_bounds", "bounds": [5, 4, 5] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "create:depot", "blockPos": [0, 1, 3] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "create:depot", "blockPos": [1, 1, 3] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "create:depot", "blockPos": [2, 1, 3] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "create:depot", "blockPos": [3, 1, 3] },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "create:deployer",
          "blockProperties": { "facing": "down" },
          "blockPos": [1, 3, 3]
        },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "create:spout", "blockPos": [2, 3, 3] },
        { "type": "show_section_and_merge", "direction": "down", "blockPos": [0, 1, 3], "blockPos2": [3, 3, 3] },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 10 },
        {
          "type": "highlight_section",
          "color": "input",
          "duration": 55,
          "blockPos": [0, 1, 3],
          "blockPos2": [0, 1, 3]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 85,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "blue",
          "point": [0.5, 2.2, 3.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "A route runs: input depot or belt, then deployers and spouts in process order, then the output depot or belt.",
            "zh_cn": "路线顺序：起点料盘或传送带，依次经过机械手和注液器，最后到终点料盘或传送带。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 90 },
        {
          "type": "highlight_section",
          "color": "white",
          "duration": 55,
          "blockPos": [1, 1, 3],
          "blockPos2": [2, 3, 3]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 90,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "point": [1.5, 3.6, 3.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Deployers and spouts sit 2 blocks above the depot they work on. Deployers face down. Pressing and cutting stay on the real Create line.",
            "zh_cn": "机械手和注液器位于其加工料盘上方 2 格处，机械手朝下。压制、切割等工序仍由真实的 Create 机器完成。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 95 },
        {
          "type": "highlight_section",
          "color": "output",
          "duration": 55,
          "blockPos": [3, 1, 3],
          "blockPos2": [3, 1, 3]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "point": [3.5, 2.2, 3.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The output depot or belt is where finished products are recovered and returned to the ME network.",
            "zh_cn": "终点料盘或传送带负责回收成品，并把成品送回 ME 网络。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 85 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "basic",
      "title": {
        "en_us": "Basic Package Distributor",
        "zh_cn": "基础封包分发器"
      },
      "steps": [
        { "type": "encapsulate_bounds", "bounds": [5, 4, 5] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "create:depot", "blockPos": [0, 1, 3] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "create:depot", "blockPos": [1, 1, 3] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "create:depot", "blockPos": [2, 1, 3] },
        {
          "type": "set_block",
          "block": "create:deployer",
          "blockProperties": { "facing": "down" },
          "blockPos": [1, 3, 3]
        },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "createpackage:basic_package_distributor", "blockPos": [1, 1, 1] },
        { "type": "show_section_and_merge", "direction": "down", "blockPos": [0, 1, 3], "blockPos2": [2, 3, 3] },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 10 },
        {
          "type": "show_section_and_merge",
          "direction": "down",
          "blockPos": [1, 1, 1],
          "blockPos2": [1, 1, 1]
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 8 },
        {
          "type": "highlight_section",
          "color": "blue",
          "duration": 55,
          "blockPos": [1, 1, 1],
          "blockPos2": [1, 1, 1]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 85,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "blue",
          "point": [1.5, 2.6, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The Basic Distributor has its own AE2 pattern slots. No Pattern Provider is needed, and one block holds one saved route.",
            "zh_cn": "基础分发器自带 AE2 样板槽，无需额外的样板供应器；一个方块保存一条路线。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 90 },
        {
          "type": "show_controls",
          "duration": 45,
          "point": [1.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "direction": "down",
          "action": "right",
          "item": "createpackage:machine_linker"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 85,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "point": [1.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Link the route with the Machine Linker in the same way as the normal distributor.",
            "zh_cn": "路线的链接方式与普通分发器相同，同样使用机器链接器。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 90 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "advanced",
      "title": {
        "en_us": "Advanced Package Distributor",
        "zh_cn": "高级封包分发器"
      },
      "steps": [
        { "type": "encapsulate_bounds", "bounds": [5, 4, 5] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "createpackage:advanced_package_distributor", "blockPos": [1, 1, 1] },
        { "type": "show_section_and_merge", "direction": "down", "blockPos": [1, 1, 1], "blockPos2": [1, 1, 1] },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 10 },
        {
          "type": "highlight_section",
          "color": "blue",
          "duration": 50,
          "blockPos": [1, 1, 1],
          "blockPos2": [1, 1, 1]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 85,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "blue",
          "point": [1.5, 2.6, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The Advanced Distributor stores no route itself. Each Mechanical Package Pattern carries the route it should run.",
            "zh_cn": "高级分发器本身不保存路线，路线保存在每张机械封包样板上。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 90 },
        {
          "type": "show_controls",
          "duration": 45,
          "point": [0.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "direction": "down",
          "action": "right",
          "item": "createpackage:mechanical_pattern_converter"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 90,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "point": [0.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Mark the route with the Mechanical Pattern Converter, then convert an AE2 pattern into a Mechanical Package Pattern.",
            "zh_cn": "用机械样板转换器标记路线，再把 AE2 样板转换为机械封包样板。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 95 },
        {
          "type": "show_controls",
          "duration": 45,
          "point": [2.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "direction": "down",
          "action": "right",
          "item": "createpackage:parallel_card"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 95,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "point": [2.5, 3.0, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Parallel Cards run more lines at once. By default each card gives 4 jobs, so 2 cards give up to 8. Lines must not share depots or machines.",
            "zh_cn": "并行卡可同时运行更多路线。默认每张卡提供 4 个作业，两张最多 8 个。不同路线之间不能共享料盘或机器。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 100 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pitfalls",
      "title": {
        "en_us": "Package Distributors: Common Mistakes",
        "zh_cn": "封包分发器：常见注意事项"
      },
      "steps": [
        { "type": "encapsulate_bounds", "bounds": [5, 4, 5] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "createpackage:package_distributor", "blockPos": [1, 1, 1] },
        { "type": "show_section_and_merge", "direction": "down", "blockPos": [1, 1, 1], "blockPos2": [1, 1, 1] },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 10 },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 85,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "red",
          "point": [1.5, 2.6, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The primary output must match exactly one Create sequenced assembly recipe. Otherwise the job is rejected before any input is used.",
            "zh_cn": "主产物必须唯一匹配一个 Create 序列组装配方，否则作业会在消耗任何输入之前被拒绝。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 90 },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 85,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "red",
          "point": [1.5, 2.6, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The base item is supplied once. Deployer items and spout fluids must be encoded for every loop, not the base item.",
            "zh_cn": "基础原料只供应一次；机械手物品和注液流体需要按全部循环次数写入样板，而不是把原料也乘以循环数。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 90 },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 85,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "red",
          "point": [1.5, 2.6, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Do not list optional byproducts as pattern outputs. AE2 waits for every listed output.",
            "zh_cn": "不要把可选副产物写进样板产物，AE2 会等待样板中列出的每一个产物。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 90 },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 85,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "red",
          "point": [1.5, 2.6, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The Advanced Distributor rejects plain AE2 patterns. Convert them to Mechanical Package Patterns first.",
            "zh_cn": "高级分发器不接受普通 AE2 样板，请先用机械样板转换器转换为机械封包样板。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 90 },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 95,
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "color": "red",
          "point": [1.5, 2.6, 1.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The distributor model is two blocks tall. Goggles or Jade show the exact rejection reason when a job is refused.",
            "zh_cn": "分发器模型高两格。作业被拒绝时，护目镜或 Jade 会显示具体原因。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 100 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
